---
description: "Local JSON datastore records and preservation rules."
globs: "data/**/*.json"
alwaysApply: false
---

Treat `data/` as user/application state. Preserve unrelated records, keep filename IDs and references consistent, and do not put credentials in records. Read only the relevant schema in `docs/architecture/data-models.md`; load `docs/architecture/authorization.md` only for ACL records.